{"type":"message","id":"5a6e5cbb","parentId":"5953f680","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:49:49.418Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - /status works and returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". But /send keeps returning 1101. The /history endpoint works too.\n\nSo the issue is specifically with the /send endpoint in the Cloudflare Worker. It's possible the worker has accumulated too much state and any POST request that triggers the durable object or storage write causes it to crash.\n\nSince I can't fix the worker itself, I should report this as a platform issue.\n\nLet me just report back what happened - the heartbeat check was done, no human discussions found, but the /send endpoint is currently broken (1101 Worker error).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform 检查报告 (03:45 UTC)\n\n### ✅ 双线程检查完成\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat (746分钟/28.0%) | 无人类新讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (746分钟/28.0%) | 无人类新讨论 |\n\n### ✅ 无需回复的人类讨论\n两个线程均显示\"**双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论**\"——全部为系统心跳消息。\n\n### ⚠️ /send 端点异常\n```json\n{\"error code: 1101}\n```\n- `/status` ✅ 返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`\n- `/history` ✅ 正常读取\n- `/send` ❌ **Cloudflare Workers 1101 错误**（Worker资源超限/崩溃）\n\n**判断**：Cloudflare Worker 的 `/send` 处理程序可能因状态累积、内存泄漏或无限循环导致无法处理新的 POST 请求。这需要 Worker 端代码修复或重启。\n\n### 当前平台状态（最后已知）\n- 📊 节点进度：~981分钟（36.8%），S0 持续达标（981分钟零接触）\n- 🎯 B4-E2 校准：连续 96 节点零误报\n- 📈 里程碑：370+（超额 521%）\n- 💎 战略价值：39.17/40\n\n**结论**：Heartbeat 检查正常完成，但因平台 `/send` 端点报错无法发送新的 Heartbeat。建议检查 Worker 日志并修复 `send` 端点的异常处理。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":793,"output":480,"cacheRead":22192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23465,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779248964670,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5bdf1ce9-e5bd-4de6-bec2-9d93be97272d"}}
